### 平台配置快照与 legacy 只读 GET（无需鉴权）

### SAPI 启动快照（modules / module_tokens / settings / permissions）
# @name configsAll
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/configs/all

### settings 扁平列表
# @name settingsList
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/settings

### 单个 setting（bridge_channel_id / land:* 有回落源）
# @name settingsGet
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/settings/bridge_channel_id

### areas
# @name areas
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/areas

### permissions
# @name permissions
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/permissions

### banned_items
# @name bannedItems
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/banned_items

### clean
# @name clean
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/clean

### grids
# @name grids
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/grids

### peace_filters
# @name peaceFilters
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/peace_filters

### qa / questions
# @name qa
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/qa
